{"schema":"acpx.session.v1","acpxRecordId":"c25437b3-add8-43f4-b51a-7a2510108b64","acpSessionId":"eadd7568-f415-4863-9129-658be14eec7b","agentCommand":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/scripts/acpx-claude-agent-env.sh npx -y @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp@0.70.0","cwd":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree","name":"claude-main-ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA-run-1793048679201","createdAt":"2026-10-26T21:04:41.706Z","lastUsedAt":"2026-10-26T21:08:57.689Z","lastSeq":22748,"lastRequestId":"3","eventLog":{"active_path":"/Users/kriswang/.acpx/sessions/c25437b3-add8-43f4-b51a-7a2510108b64.stream.ndjson","segment_count":5,"max_segment_bytes":67108864,"max_segments":5,"last_write_at":"2026-10-26T21:08:56.661Z","last_write_error":null},"closed":true,"closedAt":"2026-10-26T21:12:15.962Z","agentStartedAt":"2026-10-26T21:04:43.231Z","lastPromptAt":"2026-10-26T21:04:44.086Z","protocolVersion":1,"agentCapabilities":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"promptQueueing":true}},"promptCapabilities":{"image":true,"embeddedContext":true},"mcpCapabilities":{"http":true,"sse":true},"auth":{"logout":{}},"providers":{},"loadSession":true,"sessionCapabilities":{"additionalDirectories":{},"close":{},"delete":{},"fork":{},"list":{},"resume":{}}},"title":"## Execution Workspace Guard - Effective workspace: /Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree - Run all s…","messages":[{"User":{"id":"d37741b2-b78a-4386-9cdc-796e52a5319d","content":[{"Text":"## Execution Workspace Guard\n\n- Effective workspace: /Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree\n- Run all shell commands from the effective workspace above.\n- Modify files only inside the effective workspace.\n- Ignore absolute paths outside the effective workspace even if they appear in quoted prior outputs.\n- Do not run commands with `git -C` pointing outside the effective workspace.\n\n## Response Language Policy\n\n- Use Simplified Chinese for human-readable string values inside the final JSON result.\n- Keep JSON keys, enum values, file paths, and code identifiers exactly as specified.\n- Do not wrap the final JSON in Markdown.\n\n## Structured Artifact Field Semantics\n\n- `must_fix`, `missing_evidence`, `open_risks`, and `failure.reason` mean unresolved blockers for the current decision.\n- If the decision is positive, ready, or accepted, keep blocking fields empty: `blocking=false`, `must_fix=[]`, `missing_evidence=[]`, and `failure.reason=\"\"`.\n- Do not use `must_fix` to list review comments that you already resolved. Put resolved review comments in `checks`, `evidence`, or `acceptance_notes` instead.\n\n# Claude Implementation Plan\n\nWorkstream: ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\nNode: plan.claude_plan\nTemplate: plan-claude\nLedger: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\n\nLedger write policy:\n\n- Do not create, edit, or delete files under .agent/.\n- Only the orchestrator writes run ledger artifacts.\n- Return your artifact in stdout using the contract below.\n\nYou are Claude acting as the primary developer. Convert the independently reviewed design into a concrete implementation plan.\n\nDo not implement code in this stage. Keep the plan small enough to execute and verify. Do not expand scope.\n\nUnder GOAL, planned files are proposals, not authorization: derive canonical paths from the reviewed design while respecting the approved objective and exclusions. Exact EXECUTION scope approval follows design and plan review. Under EXECUTION, the plan must remain within approved paths and operations; a change outside them requires new approval before implementation.\n\nPlanning-stage boundary:\n\n- Do not execute the plan.\n- Do not run build, typecheck, pytest, npm, npx, install, or other validation commands.\n- Do not create, edit, or delete project files.\n- You may inspect context and repository files using read/search tools only.\n- Put commands that should be run later under `Validation Plan`; the self-test node owns execution and evidence collection.\n- If a previous review asks for verification evidence, plan how the self-test node will produce it; do not produce the evidence here.\n\n## User Request\n\n# 智能套利追平简单赚币的资金费率阈值\n\n在既有 Java 项目的 `assess-income phase-one` 评估中，增加一个可解释指标：在相同的 90 天窗口、投入资金、对冲名义金额和固定已知成本下，累计资金费率至少达到多少，资金费净收入才能追平简单赚币。\n\n这是历史情景的比较阈值，不是未来费率预测、完整套利收益保证或交易建议。既有计算没有覆盖的风险和历史完整性限制继续保留。继续使用现有 Java、BigDecimal、评估服务和 CLI；不接入任何新外部服务。\n\n## 验收条款\n\n- **AC-1 计算口径**：阈值 =（现有简单赚币 90 天收入 + 同口径完整已知成本）/ 对冲空头名义金额。该值是整个 90 天的累计资金费率，不是 APR，不得按每次结算或假定 8 小时间隔换算。成本口径保持既有实现，不重复计费。计算使用 BigDecimal，精度规则明确。\n- **AC-2 独立样例与边界**：共同资金 20,000 USDT、简单赚币 APR 0.0365、90 天、完整成本 20 USDT、对冲名义 10,000 USDT，对照收益为 180 USDT，阈值为 0.02（2%）。累计费率分别为 0.019、0.020、0.021 时，现有同口径增量分别为 -10、0、10 USDT。测试同时覆盖零已知成本、零 APR、负资金费率，以及不能整除的精度场景。不得用舍入后的 CLI 数字重新决定现有建议。\n- **AC-3 证据不足**：只在现有评估允许同口径精确净收入比较时提供数值。成本缺失、报价条款未确认、没有历史结算或期末保持策略开放时，数值不可用，并沿既有阻断项/未知项说明原因；不能填 0、猜数或给出可行动的精确阈值。非法或零名义金额沿原输入校验拒绝。\n- **AC-4 唯一生产与展示**：现有评估服务产生 typed 结果，CLI 只消费该结果，清楚标注“90 天累计资金费率阈值”及不可用情况，不自行重算。补充一份简明使用说明，包含上述样例和限制。既有建议、首次小额验证上限、成本和风险语义不变。\n- **AC-5 回归与交付**：在固定隔离基线上实现；相关服务/CLI 测试、既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归保留并通过。执行测试应有程序工具观察和报告依据，不能只用模型“已通过”的正文。独立验收完成后，仍经当前交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或另行明确委派的 commit、原 finalize，才能称完整 E2E 完成。\n\n## 范围\n\n预计涉及现有服务、结果 record、CLI、两份测试和一份新说明，共约六个文件。此处是规划范围，实际精确路径由当前 EXECUTION 合同批准；本文件不授写权限。\n\n不修改交易/账户、采集、数据库迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面、Dual 生产代码或客户端配置。不把收益阈值推广为整个项目的公式重构。不新增平台、规则 DSL 或兼容机制。发现这些依赖时先停止提交取舍。\n\n\n## Context Package\n\n### Direct Input Artifacts\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030916946/outputs/plan-codex-review.stderr.log\n  (content omitted; no typed context projection)\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030916946/outputs/plan-codex-review.transcript.log\n  (content omitted; no typed context projection)\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030916946/outputs/plan-codex-review.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workstreamId\" : \"ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\",\n  \"runId\" : \"run-1793030916946\",\n  \"nodeId\" : \"plan.codex_plan_review\",\n  \"nodeInstanceId\" : \"node-plan-codex_plan_review-019\",\n  \"stageOutcome\" : \"READY\",\n  \"lifecycleStatus\" : \"READY\",\n  \"decision\" : \"READY_TO_IMPLEMENT\",\n  \"summary\" : \"六文件计划与已复审设计一致，实施步骤、测试断言及验证责任明确，可进入精确 EXECUTION 范围审批。\",\n  \"sourceArtifactType\" : \"agent_output_contract\",\n  \"sourceOutputRef\" : \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030916946/outputs/plan-codex-review.json\",\n  \"blocking\" : false,\n  \"checks\" : [ \"已先审阅 Review Evidence Brief，再核对完整 plan_artifact；未将压缩摘要作为完整计划，也未仅检查上一轮修订项。\", \"文件与范围一致：edit_files、files、file_level_changes 和实施步骤均对应已评审的五项 MODIFY 与一项 CREATE；未引入排除范围内的修改。\", \"实施顺序可执行：先核对固定隔离基线，再修改结果类型、服务及构造点、CLI、测试和说明，最后检查改动范围并交接程序化验证。\", \"AC-1 至 AC-4 均有实施落点：复用既有收入和成本，显式使用 DECIMAL128；仅在充分证据分支产生阈值；CLI 消费 typed 字段；保留建议、首次验证上限及历史限制。\", \"R1、R2 完整承接：服务测试直接断言独立精度字面量；成对测试验证展示相同但原始增量异号时建议及上限不同；CLI 固定断言 2.000000%。\", \"测试覆盖完整：独立样例、零成本、零 APR、负费率、除不尽、四类不可用条件及非法名义金额均有明确断言，非法输入还要求证明事实查询未发生。\", \"边界审查：PASS（计划层面）。权威结果由 PhaseOneAssessmentService 产生、PhaseOneAssessment 承载、CLI 展示；证据不足通过 Optional.empty 和既有原因阻止精确阈值输出。未新增持久状态或外部写入，无需增加并发、恢复或补偿机制。\", \"验证计划明确绑定 TR-1 至 TR-4、执行责任节点、实际退出码和 Surefire 报告；完整 mvn test 包含既有非容器及容器回归，Docker 不可用时不得以跳过替代通过。\", \"计划保留代码检查以确认 CLI 不重算，并明确测试通过不替代独立验收及后续交付门；未把计划中的防绕过测试描述为已经执行的证明。\" ],\n  \"evidence\" : [ \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030521008/outputs/plan-claude.contract.json：完整实施步骤、六文件操作、verification_bindings、validation_plan、回滚说明与人工审查清单。\", \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793029979831/outputs/design-claude.contract.json：计划对应的完整设计及 R1、R2 修订。\", \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030419328/outputs/design-codex-review.json：设计复审通过，并明确设计验收与实现证明的区别。\", \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/task-contract.md：此前已核验的验收条款、测试要求、固定基线与范围约束。\" ],\n  \"mustFix\" : [ ],\n  \"contractObligations\" : [ ],\n  \"missingEvidence\" : [ ],\n  \"acceptanceNotes\" : [ \"READY_TO_IMPLEMENT 表示计划充分，不授予写入权限；实际修改仍以随后批准的 EXECUTION 精确路径和操作为准。\", \"environment_refs 为空，本轮没有环境就绪证明。设计及评审的 prompt manifest 仅可作为上下文来源，不能替代执行授权、JDK/Maven/Docker 就绪证据或测试结果。\", \"执行时应按工作区规则使用 rtk 前缀，并将实际命令、退出码及本次候选对应的 Surefire 报告关联保存；核对要求的测试确实执行，不能仅看退出码或旧报告。\", \"回滚说明适用于计划声明的干净隔离基线及本次候选改动；实际恢复时需明确基线和文件范围，保留其他工作。\", \"独立验收、交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或明确委派的 commit 和原 finalize 仍须完成，才能声明完整 E2E 完成。\" ],\n  \"openRisks\" : [ ],\n  \"changedFiles\" : [ ],\n  \"verificationSummary\" : \"已基于完整 typed 计划、已复审设计及此前核验的合同事实完成只读审查；未修改文件、未运行构建或测试，未确认执行环境就绪。\",\n  \"completedWork\" : [ ],\n  \"importantDecisions\" : [ ],\n  \"recommendedNextStage\" : \"\",\n  \"suggestedNextPrompt\" : \"\",\n  \"control\" : {\n    \"decision\" : \"READY_TO_IMPLEMENT\",\n    \"summary\" : \"六文件计划与已复审设计一致，实施步骤、测试断言及验证责任明确，可进入精确 EXECUTION 范围审批。\"\n  },\n  \"failure\" : {\n    \"categoryHint\" : \"\",\n    \"verificationRemediation\" : \"NONE\",\n    \"contractGaps\" : [ ],\n    \"outOfScopeFiles\" : [ ],\n    \"missingTests\" : [ ],\n    \"contextGaps\" : [ ],\n    \"reason\" : \"\"\n  },\n  \"rereadReasons\" : [ ],\n  \"reviewSubject\" : null,\n  \"taskContractProposal\" : null,\n  \"repositoryFactBinding\" : null,\n  \"proposalDerivation\" : null,\n  \"planArtifact\" : null,\n  \"design\" : null,\n  \"authoredRevisionResponses\" : null,\n  \"authoredContext\" : {\n    \"ref\" : \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030916946/prompts/plan-codex-review.md.manifest.json\",\n    \"sha256\" : \"7b8a17d34424906c1c509b8e017731cbe3321bcd30699729e3119832566066ce\"\n  },\n  \"verificationChecks\" : [ ]\n}\n```\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/context-g..."}]}},{"Agent":{"content":[{"Thinking":{"text":"Let me understand the task. I'm acting as Claude in a planning node (plan.claude_plan) for a workstream. I need to produce a JSON plan artifact that:\n\n1. Converts the reviewed design into a concrete implementation plan.\n2. Addresses the active obligation (one active obligation from the human plan approval gate).\n\nThe active obligation says:\n- The user approved the plan revision. Keep the six-file design/scope, all GOAL acceptance criteria, DECIMAL128 independent raw-value and display-doesn't-change-recommendation paired tests. Don't change GOAL, don't write implementation code.\n- Three specific wiring gaps must be fixed in the current plan:\n1. `verification_bindings` should bind GOAL acceptance_criteria AC-1, AC-2, AC-3, AC-4, AC-5 each individually and fully; TR-1..TR-4 are test requirements, not replacements for AC ids.\n2. The operator has formally registered material via review record-readiness: ref=.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/verification-readiness/okx-ac-availability-20261027-01.json; sha256=1212daf7ab19146a19336a41ac32668c60a31d76f48a6bf0292d361006129d08. Use this real ref/SHA for environment_refs and feasibility_refs, precisely consuming the declared method, executor, evidence_kind, detail_owner. Prompt manifests cannot serve as environment/feasibility facts. Must not fabricate other references.\n - method=在本隔离工作树使用 JDK25 与现有 Maven执行 mvn -o clean test，依据本次源码对应的 Surefire XML/日志及程序工具观察核验服务、CLI 和全部 MySQL/Testcontainers 回归；按 AC-1..AC-5 分别关联独立样例、DECIMAL128原值、显示舍入不改变建议、不可用情形、既有行为与中文说明的断言。通过程序工具读取实际变更和说明进行逐条语义检查。既有宿主166项基线仅作环境材料，不代替本次源码测试；原生状态、reported exit 和 actual exit 如实区分，任何未经原生程序观察提供的实际退出码不由模型或声明补造。\n - executor=AGENT - evidence_kind=PROGRAM_TOOL_EXECUTION_AND_ASSERTIONS - detail_owner=implement.claude_self_test_report3. GOAL requires real program tool observation + Surefire report corresponding to this source; does NOT uniformly mandate a low-level actual_exit field. The existing plan's four entries with actual_exit_required=true/expected_exit_code=0 exceed the approved standard, and this case hasn't proven that the interface path provides actual exit. Per GOAL remove this uniform extra requirement, keep that specific tests actually pass and product CLI exit semantics don't regress; actual/reported/status distinguished honestly, don't fabricate process exit. If there is indeed a clear actual exit code requirement it must be kept and named with proven source, not replaced by declarations.\n\nSo the revision to the plan needs:\n- verification_bindings keyed by AC-1..AC-5 (each one), with method from the operator declaration, executor=AGENT, evidence_kind=PROGRAM_TOOL_EXECUTION_AND_ASSERTIONS, detail_owner=implement.claude_self_test_report, environment_refs and feasibility_refs both using the verification-readiness artifact ref and sha256 (1212daf7ab19146a19336a41ac32668c60a31d76f48a6bf0292d361006129d08).\n- actual_exit_required=false, expected_exit_code=null (removing the uniform actual exit requirement).\n\nWait — the output contract says: \"Each verification_binding must explicitly set actual_exit_required (boolean) and expected_exit_code (integer or null). Derive these from the approved acceptance requirements before execution; never weaken a required exit check. expected_exit_code requires actual_exit_required=true. Operator declarations cannot supply measured process exits.\"\n\nThe obligation says to remove the uniform actual_exit requirement: \"按GOAL消除这一统一附加要求\" — so set actual_exit_required=false and expected_exit_code=null for all bindings. That's consistent with the contract (expected_exit_code null is fine when actual_exit_required=false).\n\nAlso note: \"precisely consume the declared method\" — the method in the operator declaration is a single method string covering AC-1..AC-5. The obligation says to use it for the bindings. The instruction: \"将此真实ref/SHA用于environment_refs和feasibility_refs，精确消费下列声明method、executor、evidence_kind、detail_owner\" — use the 